        "subject": "Your Gym Subscription is About to Expire",
        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#111111;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;\">\n\n  <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#111111;padding:32px 16px;\">\n    <tr>\n      <td align=\"center\">\n        <table width=\"560\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;\">\n\n          <!-- Header -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#FF4500;padding:36px 32px 28px;\">\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:3px;color:#ffcfb8;\">MEMBERSHIP EXPIRY NOTICE</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:30px;font-weight:900;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.1;\">YOUR TIME IS<br>ALMOST UP.</p>\n              <div style=\"margin-top:16px;width:48px;height:4px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:2px;\"></div>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Gradient stripe -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background:linear-gradient(90deg,#FF4500,#FF8C00,#FFD700);height:6px;font-size:0;line-height:0;\">&nbsp;</td>\n          </tr>\n\n          <!-- Body -->\n          <tr>\n            <td style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;padding:32px;\">\n\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:16px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;\">Hey {{ $json.fields['Full Name'] }},</p>\n              <p style=\"margin:0 0 28px;font-size:14px;color:#aaaaaa;line-height:1.8;\">Your gym membership is expiring soon. Don't lose your streak — renew now and keep the momentum going.</p>\n\n              <!-- Expiry cards -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-right:6px;\">\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#222222;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #FF8C00;\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding:16px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:11px;color:#888888;letter-spacing:1px;\">CURRENT PLAN</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;\">{{ $('Search records').item.json.fields.Subscription }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                  <td width=\"50%\">\n                    <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background-color:#222222;border-radius:8px;border-left:3px solid #FFD700;\">\n                      <tr>\n                        <td style=\"padding:16px;\">\n                          <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:11px;color:#888888;letter-spacing:1px;\">EXPIRES ON</p>\n                          <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#FFD700;\">{{ $('Search records').item.json.fields['End Date'] }}</p>\n                        </td>\n                      </tr>\n                    </table>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- Urgency block -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"background-color:#2a1a00;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #FF8C00;padding:20px 24px;\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;color:#FF8C00;\">&#9888; DON'T LOSE YOUR PROGRESS</p>\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#cccccc;line-height:1.8;\">Once your membership expires, gym access is paused. Renew before the deadline to avoid any interruption to your training.</p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- CTA -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom:28px;\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td align=\"center\">\n                    <a href=\"https://tally.so/r/jakBx1\" style=\"display:inline-block;background-color:#FF4500;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:900;padding:14px 36px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:1px;\">RENEW MY MEMBERSHIP</a>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n              <!-- Footer -->\n              <table width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                <tr>\n                  <td style=\"border-top:1px solid #2e2e2e;padding-top:20px;text-align:center;\">\n                    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#555555;line-height:1.7;\">Questions? Reply to this email anytime.<br>© 2026 Gym Spec. All rights reserved.</p>\n                  </td>\n                </tr>\n              </table>\n\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n\n        </table>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
